      "end": 698,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Learned counsel appearing on behalf of the petitioner submits as follows.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 699,
      "end": 773,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The alleged incriminating articles were recovered from the premises of a co-accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 774,
      "end": 858,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26092422008514404
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The petitioner complied with a notice issued by the Investigating Officer.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 859,
      "end": 933,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29327237606048584
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Learned counsel appearing on behalf of the State strongly opposes the prayer for anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 934,
      "end": 1034,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.034555159509181976
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "She submits that this is a case of food adulteration.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1035,
      "end": 1089,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07776014506816864
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "She refers to the reports, especially the one contained at page 176 of the case diary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1090,
      "end": 1176,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.023586420342326164
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "She also submits that the business was being run by the petitioner and the other co- accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1177,
      "end": 1270,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08475738763809204
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Even, no fire licence was taken for doing the manufacturing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1271,
      "end": 1331,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21333728730678558
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Considering the incriminating materials available in the case diary, I do not consider this to be a fit case for granting anticipatory bail to the present petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1332,
      "end": 1499,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16691964864730835
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The application for anticipatory bail being CRM (A) 3519 of 2025 is, thus, rejected.",
